Description: Research compendium for the manuscript. Holds the data, the
    analysis code and the Quarto sources for the manuscript, the supplementary
    material and the Supplementary Bayesian Report. This is not an R package
    and defines no functions for use elsewhere; the DESCRIPTION records the
    authorship and the dependencies of the compendium in one machine-readable
    place. The pipeline is declared in _targets.R and built with
    targets::tar_make(); the package versions it was built under are pinned in
    renv.lock.
